WEBVTT

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.494
Momma didn't agree with me much.

00:00:31.518 --> 00:00:33.448
She handed me a toothbrush and said,

00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:34.799
"Here, scrub."

00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:36.228
So I did.

00:00:36.252 --> 00:00:39.403
I'd sit at the dining room table
for what seemed like an eternity.

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:41.340
I didn't want to eat my vegetables.

00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:43.514
You probably know the feeling.

00:00:43.538 --> 00:00:46.846
I'd miss all my favorite shows
and cry like crazy.

00:00:47.537 --> 00:00:50.545
Crying was always associated
with something bad.

00:00:51.228 --> 00:00:52.656
Fortunately, I grew up.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.727
I stopped writing on the walls,
started eating my vegetables,

00:00:55.751 --> 00:00:58.310
and I entered the wonderful
world of motherhood.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:01.318
And let me tell you,
crying takes on a whole new meaning.